     "fr": 0.9995,
     "wer": 0.125,
     "cps": 16.2,
     "secs": 6.8,
     "sim": 0.807
    },
    "text": "Je fournis au Fort diverses reliques nécessaires au lancement des sorts, ainsi que des composants alchimiques.",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "q595473869",
     "voice_seed": 595473869
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T04:44:01"
   }
  },
  "15176_10649": {
   "npc": 15176,
   "page": "10649",
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\15176\\dialogue_10649.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/kalimdor/silithus/15176/dialogue_10649.flac",
    "dur": 10.4,
    "cps": 12.8,
    "model": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base",
    "engine": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base (cuda)",
    "seed": 569672296,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0009,
     "fr": 0.998,
     "wer": 0.038,
     "cps": 12.8,
     "secs": 10.4,
     "sim": 0.882
    },
    "text": "Un mal terrible s’agite. Le sentez-vous ?\n\nBah ! Bien sûr que non. Donnez-moi vos armes et votre armure et je les remettrai d’aplomb.",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "q1226666230",
     "voice_seed": 1226666230
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T04:44:03"
   }
  },
  "15180_10651": {
   "npc": 15180,
   "page": "10651",
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\15180\\dialogue_10651.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/kalimdor/silithus/15180/dialogue_10651.flac",
    "dur": 15.9,
    "cps": 15.4,
    "model": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base",
    "engine": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base (cuda)",
    "seed": 171431240,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0002,
     "fr": 0.9995,
     "wer": 0.021,
     "cps": 15.4,
     "secs": 15.9,
     "sim": 0.882
    },
    "text": "Regardez derrière vous. La ruche frémit, et tout autour de nous, le sol s’agite et tremble.\n\nL’heure est venue pour moi d’accomplir un serment que j’ai fait voici mille ans. Les sables se déplacent à nouveau. Les Qiraji se préparent à la guerre.",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "q766386352",
     "voice_seed": 766386352
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T04:44:22"
   }
  },
  "15182_10654": {
   "npc": 15182,
   "page": "10654",
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\15182\\dialogue_10654.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/kalimdor/silithus/15182/dialogue_10654.flac",
    "dur": 16.7,
    "cps": 17.9,
    "model": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base",
    "engine": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base (cuda)",
    "seed": 223503125,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0012,
     "fr": 0.9976,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 17.9,
     "secs": 16.7,
     "sim": 0.825
    },
    "text": "Le commandant n’est plus lui-même. Sa maîtresse a disparu sans laisser de traces au cours de fouilles archéologiques dans le désert du sud. Oui, parfaitement, sans laisser de traces ! Très étrange, en vérité.\n\nDites, vous cherchez du travail, non ? Est-ce que j’ai besoin d’être encore plus clair ?",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "q969716177",
     "voice_seed": 969716177
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T04:44:26"
   }
  },
  "15182_10703": {
   "npc": 15182,
   "page": "10703",
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\15182\\dialogue_10703.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/kalimdor/silithus/15182/dialogue_10703.flac",
    "dur": 8.5,
    "cps": 18.9,
    "model": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base",
    "engine": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base (cuda)",
    "seed": 1425608055,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0015,
     "fr": 0.9966,
     "wer": 0.034,
     "cps": 18.9,
     "secs": 8.5,
     "sim": 0.848
    },
    "text": "Vous chassez Poigne-de-mort? Je suis très impressionné. Elle m'a fait perdre deux hommes, rien que cette semaine. Espérons que vous aurez plus de chance qu'eux.",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "q969716177",
     "voice_seed": 969716177
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T04:44:27"
   }
  },
  "15183_10655": {
   "npc": 15183,
   "page": "10655",
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\15183\\dialogue_10655.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/kalimdor/silithus/15183/dialogue_10655.flac",
    "dur": 8.9,
    "cps": 14.3,
    "model": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base",
    "engine": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base (cuda)",
    "seed": 2142927558,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0008,
     "fr": 0.9985,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 14.3,
     "secs": 8.9,
     "sim": 0.765
    },
    "text": "Vous entendez ? Le bourdonnement devient plus fort de jour en jour. Ce doit être ces cristaux qui rendent les insectes dingues.",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "q632860820",
     "voice_seed": 632860820
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T04:44:29"
   }
