  "15306_10781": {
   "npc": 15306,
   "page": "10781",
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\15306\\dialogue_10781.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/kalimdor/silithus/15306/dialogue_10781.flac",
    "dur": 12.3,
    "cps": 16.8,
    "model": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base",
    "engine": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base (cuda)",
    "seed": 795164163,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0003,
     "fr": 0.999,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 16.8,
     "secs": 12.3,
     "sim": 0.813
    },
    "text": "Nous n’avons pas qu’un seul ennemi en Silithus. Pendant que l’attention générale se concentre sur les silithides, mon frère aîné et moi-même surveillons étroitement les fous furieux du Marteau du crépuscule.",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "q481970375",
     "voice_seed": 481970375
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T04:56:19"
   }
  },
  "15443_11005": {
   "npc": 15443,
   "page": "11005",
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\15443\\dialogue_11005.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/kalimdor/silithus/15443/dialogue_11005.flac",
    "dur": 13.0,
    "cps": 19.4,
    "model": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base",
    "engine": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base (cuda)",
    "seed": 483531313,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0003,
     "fr": 0.999,
     "wer": 0.044,
     "cps": 19.4,
     "secs": 13.0,
     "sim": 0.645
    },
    "text": "Salutations. La Brigade d’Ironforge a été cantonnée ici afin de garder un œil sur la Ruche’Zora. Les druides du Cercle cénarien, qui surveillent les mouvements des silithides, s’attendent à ce qu’il se passe quelque chose de très sérieux dans la région.",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "q2111688513",
     "voice_seed": 2111688513
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:26:31",
    "refused": {
     "by": "judge",
     "at": "2026-10-11T17:26:31",
     "failed": [
      "sim"
     ]
    }
   }
  },
  "15609_11322": {
   "npc": 15609,
   "page": "11322",
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\15609\\dialogue_11322.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/kalimdor/silithus/15609/dialogue_11322.flac",
    "dur": 13.2,
    "cps": 18.1,
    "model": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base",
    "engine": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base (cuda)",
    "seed": 1720844008,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0013,
     "fr": 0.9976,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 18.1,
     "secs": 13.2,
     "sim": 0.877
    },
    "text": "Bientôt, nous débarrasserons Azeroth de l’abominable présence des silithides. Leur potentiel de destruction est bien supérieur à ce que vous avez pu voir. Des puissances plus redoutables et plus sombres se cachent derrière leurs activités.",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "q1764575625",
     "voice_seed": 1764575625
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T04:56:24"
   }
  },
  "15611_11321": {
   "npc": 15611,
   "page": "11321",
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\15611\\dialogue_11321.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/kalimdor/silithus/15611/dialogue_11321.flac",
    "dur": 14.6,
    "cps": 15.5,
    "model": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base",
    "engine": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base (cuda)",
